# OSV findings with CISA KEV flags and FIRST EPSS scores: which of the rest to fix first.
#
# Regenerated by `pixi run demo`. See docs/development.md; the input is staged by
# scripts/demo-workspace.sh so the run needs no network and looks the same every time.

Output "docs/assets/report-epss.gif"
Source "docs/assets/_common.tape"
Set FontSize 12
Set Width 1720
Set Height 520

Hide
Type `cd "$DEMO_WORKSPACE" && PS1='$ ' && export COLUMNS=196` Enter
Type "clear" Enter
Ctrl+L
Show

Sleep 400ms
Type "pixi sbom -e web -p linux-64 -q --vulnerabilities osv --kev --epss --report vulnerabilities" Sleep 200ms Enter
Sleep 3200ms
